  "body": "<h2>The Culture of Spa Calm</h2><p>Kudowa-Zdrój is a place that has served for generations as a haven for those seeking regeneration and silence. The spa architecture, with its elegant pump rooms and wide avenues, invites you to adopt a rhythm that knows no haste.</p><p>A morning walk through the Spa Park is a lesson in mindfulness. As the sun slowly illuminates carefully trimmed hedges and colorful flowerbeds, you can feel body and mind slowly releasing tension, and breathing becomes deeper and calmer.</p><h2>The Perspective of Sudeten Ridges</h2><p>Slow travel in Kudowa is above all about exploring the surrounding hills. A hike to viewpoints from which a panorama of the entire Sudetes spreads out allows you to gain distance from everyday problems and understand that we are only part of a larger, unchanging landscape.</p><p>Instead of planning an intense schedule, it is worth devoting an afternoon to reading a book in one of the cafés in the town center, watching the slow movement of passersby and enjoying the moment when nothing has to be done right away.</p>",
